          "type": "UObject*",
          "default": "NULL"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Broadcast a localized message to all players.\nMost message deal with 0 to 2 related PlayerStates.\nThe LocalMessage class defines how the PlayerState's and optional actor are used."
